@RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7023

POST {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
  "fullName": "Admin User",
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123",
  "role": "SuperAdmin",
  "branchId": null
}
###

POST {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}
###

### 1. Get All Branch 
GET {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/branch
Accept: application/json

###
### 2. Get a Branch 
GET {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/menu/branch/1
Accept: application/json

###
### 3. Create Menu Category
POST {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/menucategory
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
  "name": "Main Course",
  "displayOrder": 1
}

###

### 4. Create Menu Item
POST {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/menu
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Grilled Chicken",
  "description": "Served with rice and vegetables",
  "basePrice": 85.00,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###

### Create Table
POST {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/table
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Table 1",
  "capacity": 4,
  "branchId": 1
}

###

### Create User (Waiter)
POST {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Waiter",
  "username": "john",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "role": "Waiter",
  "branchId": 1
}

###


### Create Order (tableId, waiterId )
POST {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/order
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "branchId": 1,
  "tableId": 1,
  "waiterId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "menuItemId": 1,
      "menuItemVariantId": null,
      "quantity": 2,
      "note": "Less spicy"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Order-এর অবস্থা দেখুন (orderId = উপরের রেসপন্স থেকে)
GET {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/order/1
Accept: application/json

###



### Order Status আপডেট করুন (Pending → InKitchen)
PATCH {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/order/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

  "InKitchen"



###

### Bill জেনারেট করুন (orderId = 1)
POST {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/bill/generate/1
Accept: application/json

###



### Payment যোগ করুন (billId = আগের রেসপন্স থেকে, paymentMethodTypeId = 1 হলো Cash)
POST {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/bill/payment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "billId": 1,
  "paymentMethodTypeId": 1,
  "amount": 195.50,
  "transactionRef": null
}

###

### Order-টা এখন Paid কিনা যাচাই করুন
GET {{RestaurantPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/order/1
Accept: application/json

###